                            7
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْهَمَلَكَ فِى الأَمْرِ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He exerted himself, strove,</i>
or <i>laboured, in the affair,</i> (S, Msb,) <i>and persisted,</i> or <i>persevered, in it.</i> (S, Msb, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْهَمَلَكَ فِى البَاطِلِ</span>
                        <i>He obstinately persevered in
vain or false affairs.</i>
